  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Thai egg salad serves 2 and takes about 20 minutes including cooking the eggs. The dressing uses "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "fish sauce",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "fish-sauce"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", lime, chilli, and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "palm sugar",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "palm-sugar"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Raw "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "shallots",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "shallots"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "fresh coriander",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "coriander-fresh"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " finish it. This is a quick, satisfying lunch served over rice or eaten on its own."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Peel the eggs while they are still warm. Cold hard-boiled eggs are harder to peel cleanly. Plunge into cold water for exactly 1 minute to stop cooking, then peel immediately."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
